Subject: Cantor Phase3 Inventory Consistency Evidence Revision Pruning and Growth

Description: Records rejected surface area and controlled proof-support growth after semantic refinement and constraint checking. It prevents a narrow honesty revision from becoming a physical producer, migration system, or speculative evidence taxonomy.

& [DispositionIdentity] is exact
  + [disposition_uuid] is 6cb48c92-74cc-4f29-91bd-738f4c1839e0
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 4625e9c8-0dbd-4c18-a818-e42df71735bc
  + [state] is pruning_complete_growth_bounded_unsigned

& [P01_DeprecatedAlias] is pruned
  + no ConsistencyClass alias, re-export, wrapper, From, Into, or type synonym
  + reason: compile success would hide required semantic migration

& [P02_SerdeLegacyAlias] is pruned
  + no alias for consistency or quiescent_double_inventory
  + reason: silent decoding would assign new meaning to old bytes

& [P03_DefaultOrUnknown] is pruned
  + no Default, Unknown, Other, untagged, or catch-all value
  + reason: evidence grade must be explicit and closed

& [P04_SupervisorQuiescedVariant] is deferred
  + no current variant for supervisor-quiesced repeated equality
  + reason: exact process, writer, enforcement, and external uncertainty contract is not designed

& [P05_SnapshotProvenanceFields] is deferred
  + no snapshot primitive, identity, issuer, mount, lifetime, or acquisition fields
  + reason: keeping reserved enum vocabulary does not authorize its receipt use

& [P06_PhysicalAcquisitionEnvelope] is deferred
  + no first and second acquisition record, start tick, completion tick, or producer identity
  + reason: M2C source and Win32 authority are absent

& [P07_ReceiptIssuer] is pruned
  + no constructor, signer, content-addressing change, or issuance entry point
  + reason: slice is pure form revision only

& [P08_ConsumerLedger] is pruned
  + no freshness clock, uniqueness ledger, single-use state, work packet, or admission
  + reason: Phase3B integration is later M2E

& [P09_ProfileMigration] is pruned
  + no old-to-new JSON conversion or persisted-state job
  + reason: no live producer or persisted consumer exists

& [P10_PhysicalAndEffectWork] is pruned
  + no filesystem, Windows, process, fixture, model, mutation, seal, test effect, cleanup, or promotion
  + reason: explicit source stop boundary

& [P11_UnrelatedFormCleanup] is pruned
  + no renames or refactors outside selected profile, enum, field, validation, docs, and tests
  + reason: preserves predecessor invariants and rollback

& [P12_ExtraEvidenceVariants] is pruned
  + no probabilistic, best-effort, stable, clean, quiescent, transactional, or immutable grades
  + reason: no proven producer or consumer requirement

& [G01_StaticVocabularyTest] is accepted bounded growth
  + independent source scan requires new names and rejects old production names and compatibility mechanisms
  + reason: machine meaning regression is otherwise easy to reintroduce

& [G02_LegacyFixtureTable] is accepted bounded growth
  + explicit old profile, field, token, missing, and dual-field JSON negatives
  + reason: strict replacement is a core requirement

& [G03_ReservedSnapshotFault] is accepted bounded growth
  + direct semantic validation fixture for OsSnapshotProven rejection
  + reason: enum availability and receipt admissibility must remain separate

& [G04_MultiAuthoritySignatureTable] is accepted bounded growth
  + one canonical table binds two implementation authorities and two compatibility formations
  + reason: single-authority signature would leave conflicting machine meaning

& [G05_RecursiveEvidence] is accepted bounded growth
  + clone-portable revision manifest and dependency-first current-manifest rehash
  + reason: shared modules and central surfaces have broad evidence blast radius

& [G06_DocumentationNonclaim] is accepted bounded growth
  + rustdoc beside enum and receipt field states form validity is not acquisition or issuer proof
  + reason: type names alone cannot carry every authority boundary

& [GrowthBudget] is exact
  + production modules changed at most two
  + new production modules zero
  + new dependencies zero
  + new effect entry points zero
  + new admitted receipt grades zero relative to one weakest current grade
  + one old grade removed and one precise grade replaces it

& [DispositionDecision] is passed
  + selected implementation remains smaller than the raw problem space
  + all deferred items require new source and authority
  + no pruned item reappears in later SJS artifacts without source revision
  + implementation authority is absent
  + physical authority is absent
